/srv/claude/research/motor-unit-representation/logs/B01-step3-reviewBA-attempt1.log:1344:52:**C-B01-A-01 [CRITICAL].** A supplies explicit premises, scope, conclusion, operational test, and falsifier, and labels the claim Candidate. Its Grade-1 necessity conclusion nevertheless fails for the reasons in §2. Architecture independence also requires realizability and differentiability; derivatives are not directly defined for arbitrary tabular critics.
